    {
      "name": "ke_label_component",
      "doc": "A screen-space text label. Text/anchor/offset/color/font are the caller\u0027s input; glyph_count and glyphs[] are output, written each KE_PHASE_UPDATE tick by the \u0022render.ui.labels\u0022 system and read by \u0022render.ui\u0022 (KE_PHASE_RENDER) to draw them \u2014 the same sim-writes/render-reads split every other render component uses, so there is no per-glyph entity, no CPU-side accumulator, no pool to grow or reuse.",
      "tags": [
        "node:Label",
        "components:Node3D"
      ],
